<title>CENTRAL AFRICAN REPUBLIC: French clash with rebels in Bangui -French army.</title>
<headline>French clash with rebels in Bangui -French army.</headline>
<dateline>BANGUI 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>French troops fought a gunbattle with mutinous local soldiers in Central African Republic on Thursday, killing one rebel and capturing another, the French army said.</p>
<p>A military statement said there were no French casualties.</p>
</text>
